   "widgets_values": [
    "Photorealistic cinematic neo-noir crime drama, 16:9. Natural skin with visible pores, realistic materials, hard industrial lighting, organic depth of field. <Picture 1> is crime boss Wu Ya: exact facial bone structure, sleek dark hair, dark tailored suit. <Picture 2> is the henchman: short crew haircut, subservient, dark clothing. <Picture 3> is an underground boxing gym: octagonal iron cage ring, concrete mezzanine with metal railings, harsh overhead spotlights, smoky crowd. <Picture 4> is a lit cigarette: white rolled paper, burning orange ember, thin curling smoke. No beautification, no anime stylization, no on-screen text or subtitles, no background music.",
    "[Shot 1] High-angle wide establishing shot inside <Picture 3>. Camera tilts down across the cavernous room. Two sweat-sheened fighters grapple inside the octagonal iron cage, trading heavy body blows. A rowdy crowd of gamblers shouts and pumps fists through haze and rising cigarette smoke.\n[Shot 2] Medium-long low-angle shot, slow lateral pan along the second-floor metal railing. <Picture 1> leans sideways against the iron balustrade holding <Picture 4>, a wisp of smoke curling upward. Cold unblinking eyes stay locked on the fighting pit below. Two bodyguards stand in rigid silence in the soft-focus background.\n[Shot 3] Medium over-the-shoulder shot from behind the subject. <Picture 2> steps forward from the shadows and halts at a respectful distance, head slightly lowered, gaze deferential. He delivers a report with precise lip-sync, jaw shaping each syllable: <d>[Chinese] 鸦哥，何勇到了。</d>\n[Shot 4] Side-profile medium shot at eye level with a slow lateral tracking move. <Picture 1> keeps his head fixed toward the cage. He raises <Picture 4> to his lips, inhales as the ember glows orange, lowers his hand and exhales a dense plume of white smoke. Cold gaze fixed on the bloodstained canvas, he speaks with exact mouth articulation: <d>[Chinese] 让他打一场给我看。</d>",
